Subject: [PATCH] Clean up legacy backup notifications after upgrade

Keep the collision-free Signal IDs for new backup alerts, and remove old Molly alerts only when the active notification matches the backup channel. This avoids deleting old conversation notifications that shared the previous numeric range.

